[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0010","text":"甜花——！\n差不多该走了哦～\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0020","text":"好，好哦～……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0030","text":"好、好的……！\n那，走吧——\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0040","text":"——小奈……！\n头发……\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0050","text":"等一下……！\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0060","text":"甜花……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0070","text":"小奈……\n转过去一下……\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0080","text":"啊，嗯……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0090","text":"……！\n难道说，甘奈……\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0100","text":"嗯，有睡痕……所以……\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0110","text":"这样啊～……\n嘿嘿……可能还有点迷迷糊糊的吧……\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0120","text":"诶嘿嘿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0130","text":"感觉像是感冒那时候的\n后续一样呢～\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0140","text":"给我做饭啊什么的\n照顾了甘奈好多事情对吧？\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0150","text":"嗯、嗯……！\n跟平时……反过来了……\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0160","text":"甜花当小奈……\n小奈当……甜花……！\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0170","text":"嘿嘿／嘿嘿……\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0180","text":"头发……\n弄好了……\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0190","text":"嘿嘿，谢谢！\n那，走吧！\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_04030000_02_0200","text":"嗯……！"}]
